isselbaar voor euro's bij de loketten van de Nationale Bank van België (NBB) in Brussel.","note":"Dit biljet verving de oudere reeksen met Koning Boudewijn en was tot de invoering van de euro in 2002 een van de meest gebruikte biljetten in het dagelijks leven in België.","folders":[],"photos":{"front":"photos/bdb00a70-b395-45bf-8bd7-449ea84b54f4-front.jpg","back":"photos/bdb00a70-b395-45bf-8bd7-449ea84b54f4-back.jpg"},"cc":"BE","region":"Western Europe","id":"bdb00a70-b395-45bf-8bd7-449ea84b54f4","created":1793648821814,"updated":1793648860120},{"type":"note","country":"United Kingdom","denom":"20","unit":"Pound","series":"Series E","year":"1991 – 1999","qty":5,"lo":23.91,"hi":30,"face":23.91,"status":"legal","color":"#96928f","front":"","back":"","where":"Still valid money in United Kingdom. Change it at a currency exchange office (for example GWK Travelex in the Netherlands; many banks in Belgium and the Netherlands no longer change cash), or spend it in United Kingdom. An exchange office pays a little less than the market rate. Central banks do not buy valid foreign money by post.","note":"Dit biljet introduceerde destijds een sterk glanzend, dikker metaalfolie-element op de voorkant om het namaken met de destijds opkomende kleurenkopieerapparaten onmogelijk te maken.","folders":[],"photos":{"front":"photos/c4935907-982c-493d-8e9e-a003704a316f-front.jpg","back":"photos/c4935907-982c-493d-8e9e-a003704a316f-back.jpg"},"cc":"GB","region":"Western Europe","id":"c4935907-982c-493d-8e9e-a003704a316f","created":1793650981656,"updated":1793650981656},{"type":"note","country":"United Kingdom","denom":"1","unit":"Pound","series":"","year":"","qty":1,"lo":1.2,"hi":5.5,"face":1.2,"status":"exch","color":"#8f967e","front":"","back":"","where":"Onbeperkt inwisselbaar via de post bij de Bank of England in Londen.","note":"","folders":[],"photos":{"front":"photos/cc83e5d0-8271-4c73-b648-613ecece6c65-front.jpg","back":"photos/cc83e5d0-8271-4c73-b648-613ecece6c65-back.jpg"},"cc":"GB","region":"Western Europe","id":"cc83e5d0-8271-4c73-b648-613ecece6c65","created":1793651644346,"updated":1793651644346},{"type":"note","country":"Belgium","denom":"200","unit":"Frank","series":"","year":"1995","qty":3,"lo":4,"hi":20,"face":4.96,"status":"exch","color":"#967e64","front":"","back":"","where":"Onbeperkt inwisselbaar voor euro's bij de Nationale Bank van België (NBB) in Brussel.","note":"Dit was het allereerste en enige biljet van 200 Belgische frank dat ooit in omloop is gebracht. Het werd speciaal geïntroduceerd om burgers alvast te laten wennen aan een coupure die qua waarde erg dicht bij het toekomstige 5 eurobiljet lag.","folders":[],"photos":{"front":"photos/cd9896f9-19de-42d7-a7b3-d90add3b53ef-front.jpg","back":"photos/cd9896f9-19de-42d7-a7b3-d90add3b53ef-back.jpg"},"cc":"BE","region":"Western Europe","id":"cd9896f9-19de-42d7-a7b3-d90add3b53ef","created":1793647925583,"updated":1793648091268},{"type":"note","country":"Canada","denom":"2","unit":"Dollar","series":"","year":"1986","qty":1,"lo":1.3,"hi":7.5,"face":1.3,"status":"legal","color":"#967775","front":"","back":"","where":"Wettig betaalmiddel (Legal tender), hoewel het biljet sinds 1 januari 2021 niet meer actief in winkels mag worden gebruikt als wisselgeld. Het behoudt altijd zijn nominale waarde en kan bij de centrale bank (Bank of Canada) kosteloos worden omgewisseld.","note":"","folders":[],"photos":{"front":"photos/cefe7bf6-91a2-470d-875d-9126f79689c3-front.jpg","back":"photos/cefe7bf6-91a2-470d-875d-9126f79689c3-back.jpg"},"cc":"CA","region":"North America","id":"cefe7bf6-91a2-470d-875d-9126f79689c3","created":1793646246286,"updated":1793646246286},{"type":"note","country":"Belgium","denom":"50","unit":"Frank","series":"","year":"1966","qty":2,"lo":1.24,"hi":8,"face":1.24,"status":"exch","color":"#968575","front":"","back":"","where":"Nationale Bank van België, Brussels (also by registered post) — no end date. Check that this series is still accepted.","note":"Omdat dit een biljet